ce around me a missile"}, {"id": "pote-enclitic-word35", "translation": "Where at some time must the ends of these toils"}, {"id": "pote-enclitic-word36", "translation": "What at some time again is this rustling"}, {"id": "pote-enclitic-word37", "translation": "Where at some time must you, having reached the end of these labors"}, {"id": "pote-enclitic-word38", "translation": "Why ever, O son of Cronus, why ever did you yoke me to these, having found me erring in"}, {"id": "pote-enclitic-word39", "translation": "Who ever named her so altogether"}, {"id": "pote-enclitic-word40", "translation": "Whither at some time"}, {"id": "pote-enclitic-word41", "translation": "What"}, {"id": "pote-enclitic-word42", "translation": "Who ever would pray"}, {"id": "pote-enclitic-word43", "translation": "at some time"}, {"id": "pote-enclitic-word44", "translation": "What ever"}, {"id": "pote-enclitic-word45", "translation": "Who ever is this gathering"}, {"id": "pote-enclitic-word46", "translation": "Of whom ever"}, {"id": "pote-enclitic-word47", "translation": "Who ever"}, {"id": "pote-enclitic-word48", "translation": "What ever fair voyage"}, {"id": "pote-enclitic-word49", "translation": "Who ever is the"}, {"id": "pote-enclitic-word50", "translation": "Why ever do you not approach"}, {"id": "pote-enclitic-word51", "translation": "what ever"}, {"id": "pote-enclitic-word52", "translation": "Why then was the Darian archer-commander so unharmed"}, {"id": "pote-enclitic-word53", "translation": "what ever M"}, {"id": "pote-enclitic-word54", "translation": "what ever again"}, {"id": "pote-enclitic-word55", "translation": "why ever again"}, {"id": "pote-enclitic-word56", "translation": "Another example from Aeschylus is"}, {"id": "pote-enclitic-word57", "translation": "Why ever to me this"}, {"id": "pote-enclitic-word58", "translation": "I have conjectured that the third [example] Pers. 532 should be restored"}, {"id": "pote-enclitic-word59", "translation": "O king Zeus, why ever do you af